window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They say what doesn't kill you makes you stronger. I survived, but at what cost?</p> <p>They aren't going to stop until they get victory and more blood is shed. We're all in danger, fighting to stay on top.</p> <p>The most unlikely alliances are forming. But I guess that's what happens when you anger the masses. It's a tale as old as time—rivals coming together when war is brewing on the horizon.</p> <p>A deadly rival club threatens to bring us all down. But that's not the only problem I have. I have to fight to keep us all together.</p> <p>And that might be the biggest challenge of all.</p> <p><i>Recklessly Damaged</i> is a reverse harem taboo romance—meaning the main female character will have more than one love interest. It contains adult themes, course language, and is intended for mature audiences. </p> <p><i>Recklessly Damaged</i> is book 3 in The Lies We Keep series.</p>"; 
